---
description: An `alt`/`else` block covering a success and a failure branch.
config:
  look: classic
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A@{ "type" : "actor" }
  participant B@{ "type" : "boundary" }
  alt Successful case
    A ->> B: Request
    B -->> A: Success
  else Failure case
    A ->> B: Request
    B --x A: Failure
  end
